OL,3,GNEWSAHalloween fans warned over
OL,4,Ascarefest scam
OL,5,
OL,6,FTechnology expert David McClelland said
OL,7,Fhe believed artificial intelligence was
OL,8,Fused to create the "convincing"
OL,9,Fwebsite. The company has been contacted
OL,10,Ffor comment.
